  "title": "When a Client Wants to Thank Their Caregiver: A Guide to Ethical Estate Planning",
  "summary": "When a client wishes to leave a portion of their estate to their caregiver, ethical and legal considerations are paramount. This guide outlines the necessary steps to protect the client's wishes and avoid potential legal issues, including the importance of consulting an estate planning attorney and maintaining transparency with family and friends.",
